From 4dfb2ce48f863cdc6922a526136e9fea81c11182 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Do <david.do@openkingdom.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 22:56:38 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 02/21] 9chain-a1: lop identity + tham so mang chu quyen

Lop lam 9Chain-A1 khac avalanchego. Truoc commit nay no ton tai duy nhat
duoi dang uncommitted working-tree changes -> mot lenh `git checkout .` la mat sach.

- version/constants.go            : client 9chaingo
- utils/constants/network_ids.go  : networkID 9001 (uint32)
- genesis/genesis.go, params.go   : token LOVE9, HRP love9
- genesis/genesis_9chain_a1.go    : genesis + tham so kinh te mang A1 (file moi)
- config/config.go                : getStakingConfig + getTxFeeConfig cho A1NetworkID
- graft/subnet-evm/scripts/constants.sh : VM love9evm

BAY: tham so kinh te KHONG doc tu genesis.GetStakingConfig. config/config.go chi
khoa cung cho Mainnet/Fuji; moi networkID khac lay tu co CLI viper mac dinh
LocalParams. Them case vao params.go la CHUA DU - phai va ca getStakingConfig
va getTxFeeConfig. Kiem tra:
  docker logs 9chain-a1-node-1 2>&1 | head -1 | grep -o '"maxValidatorStake":[0-9]*'
  -> phai ra 50000000000000000
